notes.content:
Hey all, 

We're very excited to present a new Causa Update, which includes Duplicate Protection for Legendary Cards, new types of cosmetic items in the Market, and significant game balance changes. Find out all the details on the Patch Notes below!

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/34935535/a17d76c7e017665038ea604994e966184bba5f33.png

PATCH NOTES 1.0.5


 We implemented Duplicate Protection for Legendary Cards, which means that, when opening Card Packs, you will only get your third copy of a Legendary Card if you have already completed your collection of 2 copies of every Legendary Cards available in the game. 

 We updated the Market section with new types of Charms, so now it’s possible to purchase Avatars and Banners. We also modified the amount of Charms available in the store, and revealed 4 new Card Back designs. The Charms available for purchase will rotate approximately every 3 weeks. 

 We added a confirmation pop-up to Create and Consume Cards in the Card Crafting Section. 

  We redesigned the Level 6 Leader Decision of Danu: 

Before: Sum Awakens, and Heal. 

Now: Summon (Invoke a Sumkala Disciple, a Sumkala Pilgrim and a Sumkala Telepath), and Obtain (Invoke a Pure Sum - Support, Level 6, “at the end of each turn, you Heal 2. You have +1 Play”).

 The following cards were buffed: 

- Rovalian Aristocrat (Lvl 4 instead of 5, but 2/3 instead of 2/4); 

- Grain Silo (Lvl 4 instead of 6); Inheritance (Gather 3 instead of 2); 

- Criminal Plans (Lvl 3 instead of 4); 

- Imperial Diplomat (Attack 2 instead of 1); 

- Metamorphosize (Lvl 6 instead of 7); 

- Sacrifice (only your Leader takes 1 Damage instead of all Allies); 

- Festival Mask (Lvl 5 instead of 6); 

 -Deadly Poison (Lvl 3 instead of 4); 

- Poisoned Shiv (Lvl 4 instead of 5).

 The following cards were nerfed: 

- Donate to the Rabble (Lvl 3 instead Lvl 2); 

- Panacea (2 Uses instead of 3); 

- Prana (2 Uses instead of 3).

 The following cards were redesigned: 

- Heroic Speech, from Lvl 8, “Give +2/+2,Vigilant and Aggressive to your Characters”, to Lvl 6, “Give +1/+1 to your Characters, then gain +1 Play for the turn”; 

- Grotty Tavern, from Lvl 6, “When you Use Goods, give Aggressive to your Mercenaries”, to “At the start of your turn, Heal 1 to your Mercenaries and give them +1 Attack”; 

- Guard Service, from Lvl 5, “Use: Give +1/+2 and Protection to a friendly Character”, to Lvl 4, “Use: Give +1/+1 and Protection to a friendly Character”; 

- Ciadelian Parliament, from Lvl 4, “When you play a Schemer, give it Protection”, to Lvl 5, “Your Schemers have +1 Attack. You have +1 Play”; 

- Blood Handler, from Lvl 3, 1/3, “When it takes Damage, add an Apparition to your Hand”, to Lvl 3, 1/2, “Initiative: You take 1 Damage, then Invoke an Apparition”; 

- Cannon Fire, from Lvl 5, "Use: Deal 4 Damage to any Target, then Expend 1”, to Lvl 4, "Deal 4 Damage to any Character, then Expend 1”. 

Note: Due to a technical issue, some of the balanced cards won’t have their corresponding visual effects on this update, but we’ll fix it for next time. 

Next week we'll start discussing the design of the upcoming Ranked Mode on our Discord Community. Make sure to join us to stay tuned and share your feedback with us. Let's keep creating Causa together!
